{"id":"reference/Pointers","kind":"langref","title":"指针","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Pointers","file":"reference/Pointers.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Pointers","text":"指针"},{"depth":3,"slug":"volatile","text":"volatile"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Alignment","text":"对齐"},{"depth":3,"slug":"allowzero","text":"allowzero"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers","text":"哨兵终止指针"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Pointers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 提供两种指针：单项指针和多项指针。</p>\n      <ul>\n          <li><span data-langref-run=\"\"><code>*T</code> —— 恰好指向一个元素的单项指针。</span><ul>\n              <li>支持解引用语法：<code>ptr.*</code></li>\n              <li>支持切片语法：<code>ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]</code></li>\n              <li>支持指针相减：<code>ptr - ptr</code></li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n          <li><span data-langref-run=\"\"><code>[*]T</code> —— 指向未知数量元素的多项指针。</span><ul>\n              <li>支持索引语法：<code>ptr[i]</code></li>\n              <li>支持切片语法：<code>ptr[start..end]</code> 和 <code>ptr[start..]</code></li>\n              <li>支持指针与整数的算术运算：<code>ptr + int</code>、<code>ptr - int</code></li>\n              <li>支持指针相减：<code>ptr - ptr</code></li>\n            </ul><span data-langref-run=\"\"><code>T</code> 必须具有已知大小，因此不能是 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyopaque</span></code> 或其他任何<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">不透明类型</a>。</span></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>这些类型与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a>及<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slices\">切片</a>密切相关：</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li><span data-langref-run=\"\"><code>*[N]T</code> —— 指向 N 个元素的指针，相当于指向数组的单项指针。</span><ul>\n                <li>支持索引语法：<code>array_ptr[i]</code></li>\n                <li>支持切片语法：<code>array_ptr[start..end]</code></li>\n                <li>支持 len 属性：<code>array_ptr.len</code></li>\n                <li>支持指针相减：<code>array_ptr - array_ptr</code></li>\n            </ul>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <ul>\n            <li><span data-langref-run=\"\"><code>[]T</code> —— 切片，即包含一个 <code>[*]T</code> 类型指针和一个长度的胖指针。</span><ul>\n                <li>支持索引语法：<code>slice[i]</code></li>\n                <li>支持切片语法：<code>slice[start..end]</code></li>\n                <li>支持 len 属性：<code>slice.len</code></li>\n            </ul>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>使用 <code>&amp;x</code> 获取单项指针：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_single_item_pointer.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"address of syntax\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 获取变量地址：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x_ptr = &amp;x;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对指针解引用：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, x_ptr.*);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 获取 const 变量的地址，得到的是常量单项指针。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x_ptr));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 若要修改值，需要获取可变变量的地址：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> y_ptr = &amp;y;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(y_ptr));\n    y_ptr.* += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5679</span>, y_ptr.*);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer array access\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 获取单个元素的地址会得到</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 单项指针。此类指针</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 不支持指针算术运算。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">7</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = &amp;array[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(ptr));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, array[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>]);\n    ptr.* += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, array[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>]);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"slice syntax\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 获取指向变量的指针：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x_ptr = &amp;x;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用切片语法转换为数组指针：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x_array_ptr = x_ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x_array_ptr));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 强制转换为多项指针：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x_many_ptr: [*]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = x_array_ptr;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, x_many_ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_single_item_pointer.zig</kbd>\n1/3 test_single_item_pointer.test.address of syntax...OK\n2/3 test_single_item_pointer.test.pointer array access...OK\n3/3 test_single_item_pointer.test.slice syntax...OK\nAll 3 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>Zig 支持指针算术运算。最好将指针赋值给 <code>[*]T</code> 后递增该变量。例如，直接递增切片中的指针会破坏切片状态。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_pointer_arithmetic.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer arithmetic with many-item pointer\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ptr: [*]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = &amp;array;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    ptr += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对多项指针切片时省略结束位置，等价于</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 指针算术运算：`ptr[start..] == ptr + start`</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..], ptr + <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 除切片外，任意两个指针均支持按元素大小计算的指针相减</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, &amp;ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] - &amp;ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer arithmetic with slices\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> length: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 var 使其仅在运行时已知</span>\n    _ = &amp;length; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 抑制“变量从未被修改”的错误</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> slice = array[length..array.len];\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, slice.len);\n\n    slice.ptr += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 由于 len 未更新，切片现在处于无效状态</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, slice.len);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_pointer_arithmetic.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_pointer_arithmetic.test.pointer arithmetic with many-item pointer...OK\n2/2 test_pointer_arithmetic.test.pointer arithmetic with slices...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>在 Zig 中，通常优先使用<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slices\">切片</a>而非<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers\">哨兵终止指针</a>。可以使用切片语法将数组或指针转换为切片。</p>\n      <p>切片具有边界检查，因此能够防止这类非法行为。这也是优先使用切片而非指针的原因之一。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_slice_bounds.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer slicing\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">7</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> start: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 var 使其仅在运行时已知</span>\n    _ = &amp;start; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 抑制“变量从未被修改”的错误</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice = array[start..<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, slice.len);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, array[<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>]);\n    slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, array[<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>]);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_slice_bounds.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_slice_bounds.test.pointer slicing...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>只要代码不依赖未定义的内存布局，指针在编译时也可以使用：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_comptime_pointers.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"comptime pointers\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = &amp;x;\n        ptr.* += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, ptr.*);\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_comptime_pointers.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_comptime_pointers.test.comptime pointers...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrFromInt</span></code> 将整数地址转换为指针，使用 <code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span></code> 将指针转换为整数：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_integer_pointer_conversion.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"@intFromPtr and @ptrFromInt\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr: *<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrFromInt</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0xdeadbee0</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> addr = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(ptr);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(addr));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0xdeadbee0</span>, addr);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_integer_pointer_conversion.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_integer_pointer_conversion.test.@intFromPtr and @ptrFromInt...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>只要从不解引用该指针，Zig 就能在编译时代码中保留内存地址：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_comptime_pointer_conversion.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"comptime @ptrFromInt\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// Zig 可以在编译时执行此操作，前提是</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 从不对 ptr 解引用。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr: *<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrFromInt</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0xdeadbee0</span>);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> addr = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(ptr);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(addr));\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0xdeadbee0</span>, addr);\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_comptime_pointer_conversion.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_comptime_pointer_conversion.test.comptime @ptrFromInt...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#ptrCast\">@ptrCast</a> 将指针的元素类型转换为另一种类型。它创建的新指针可能因经由该指针进行的读取和写入而导致无法检测的非法行为。如果可以，通常应优先选择其他类型转换，而非 <code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrCast</span></code>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_pointer_casting.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> native_endian = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>).target.cpu.arch.endian();\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer casting\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> bytes: [<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@alignOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>)) = .{ <span class=\"tok-number\">0x10</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0x20</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0x30</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0x40</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> u32_ptr: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrCast</span>(&amp;bytes);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 因为直接重新解释内存字节，从 `u32_ptr` 读取的</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `u32` 值取决于目标平台的字节序：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (native_endian) {\n        .little =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0x40302010</span>, u32_ptr.*),\n        .big =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0x10203040</span>, u32_ptr.*),\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 若要重新解释 `bytes` 的逻辑位表示，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 且不依赖目标字节序，应使用 `@bitCast`，它始终将</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 位置更靠前的数组元素放入更低的有效位：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0x40302010</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@bitCast</span>(bytes)));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer child type\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 指针类型的 `child` 字段表示其指向的类型。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(*<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>).pointer.child);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_pointer_casting.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_pointer_casting.test.pointer casting...OK\n2/2 test_pointer_casting.test.pointer child type...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#ptrFromInt\">@ptrFromInt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#intFromPtr\">@intFromPtr</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C-Pointers\">C 指针</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      <h3 id=\"volatile\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#volatile\">volatile</a></h3>\n\n      <p>默认假设内存读取和写入没有副作用。如果某次读写应该有副作用，例如内存映射输入输出（MMIO），则使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span></code>。在以下代码中，带 <code>mmio_ptr</code> 的所有读写都保证发生，并且与源码顺序一致：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_volatile.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"volatile\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mmio_ptr: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrFromInt</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0x12345678</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(mmio_ptr));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_volatile.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_volatile.test.volatile...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>注意，<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span></code> 与并发和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Atomics/#Atomics\">原子操作</a>无关。如果某段代码将 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span></code> 用于内存映射输入输出之外的场景，那很可能是程序错误。</p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Alignment\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Alignment\">对齐</a></h3>\n\n      <p>每种类型都具有<strong>对齐</strong>要求，其值是一个字节数。该类型的值从内存读取或写入内存时，内存地址必须能够被该数整除。可以使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#alignOf\">@alignOf</a> 查询任意类型的对齐要求。</p>\n      <p>对齐取决于 CPU 架构，但始终是二的幂，且小于 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> &lt;&lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">29</span></code>。</p>\n      <p>指针类型可以显式指定以字节计的对齐要求。如果未指定，默认与其底层类型的对齐要求相同。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_variable_alignment.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> builtin = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"variable alignment\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;x));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(&amp;x) % <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@alignOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 隐式对齐的指针可以强制转换为显式对齐的指针，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对齐值等于底层类型 `i32` 的对齐要求：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@alignOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>)) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = &amp;x;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, ptr.*);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_variable_alignment.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_variable_alignment.test.variable alignment...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>类似于 <code>*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span></code> 可以<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>为 <code>*<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span></code>，具有更大对齐值的指针也可以隐式转换为更小对齐值的指针，反之则不允许。</p>\n      <p>可以为变量和函数指定对齐要求，指向它们的指针会获得所指定的对齐要求：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_variable_func_alignment.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> foo: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) = <span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"global variable alignment\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;foo)).pointer.attrs.@\"align\");\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;foo));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> as_pointer_to_array: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) [<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = &amp;foo;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> as_slice: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = as_pointer_to_array;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> as_unaligned_slice: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = as_slice;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>, as_unaligned_slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">derp</span>() <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@sizeOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) * <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n}\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">noop1</span>() <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {}\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">noop4</span>() <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"function alignment\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, derp());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(derp));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@sizeOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) * <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;derp));\n\n    noop1();\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(noop1));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;noop1));\n\n    noop4();\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(noop4));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> () <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;noop4));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_variable_func_alignment.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_variable_func_alignment.test.global variable alignment...OK\n2/2 test_variable_func_alignment.test.function alignment...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>如果指针或切片声明的对齐值较小，但你知道实际满足更大的对齐要求，可以使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#alignCast\">@alignCast</a> 将其转换为对齐要求更高的指针。运行时它本身不执行操作，但会插入<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Incorrect-Pointer-Alignment\">安全检查</a>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pointer alignment safety\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array <span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">0x11111111</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0x11111111</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> bytes = std.mem.sliceAsBytes(array[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0x11111111</span>, foo(bytes));\n}\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(bytes: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice4 = bytes[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> int_slice = std.mem.bytesAsSlice(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>([]<span class=\"tok-kw\">align</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@alignCast</span>(slice4)));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> int_slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.test.pointer alignment safety...thread 701624 panic: incorrect alignment\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig:10:68: 0x124c7f6 in foo (test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig)\n    const int_slice = std.mem.bytesAsSlice(u32, @as([]align(4) u8, @alignCast(slice4)));\n                                                                   ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig:6:48: 0x124c62e in test.pointer alignment safety (test_incorrect_pointer_alignment.zig)\n    try std.testing.expectEqual(0x11111111, foo(bytes));\n                                               ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)\n        if (test_fn.func()) |_| {\n                        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)\n        return mainTerminal(init);\n                           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{\n                                                                                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\nerror: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:\n/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/5590f74b0012b309979410fad799928d/test --seed=0x555ce0ab\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"allowzero\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#allowzero\">allowzero</a></h3>\n\n      <p>此指针属性允许指针的地址为零。只有地址零可被映射的独立环境操作系统目标才需要它。如果要表示空指针，请改用<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a>。具有 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">allowzero</span></code> 属性的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a>与普通指针的大小不同。在此示例中，如果指针没有 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">allowzero</span></code> 属性，就会触发<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Pointer-Cast-Invalid-Null\">指针转换产生无效空值</a>恐慌：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_allowzero.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"allowzero\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> zero: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 var 使其仅在运行时已知</span>\n    _ = &amp;zero; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 抑制“变量从未被修改”的错误</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">allowzero</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ptrFromInt</span>(zero);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(ptr));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_allowzero.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_allowzero.test.allowzero...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers\">哨兵终止指针</a></h3>\n\n      <p>语法 <code>[*:x]T</code> 表示长度由哨兵值决定的指针。这能防止缓冲区溢出和越界读取。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">sentinel-terminated_pointer.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 也可以使用 `std.c.printf`。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"c\"</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">printf</span>(format: [*:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, ...) <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    _ = printf(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, world!\\n\"</span>); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 正确</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> msg = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, world!\\n\"</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> non_null_terminated_msg: [msg.len]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = msg.*;\n    _ = printf(&amp;non_null_terminated_msg);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe sentinel-terminated_pointer.zig -lc</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/sentinel-terminated_pointer.zig:11:16: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">expected type '[*:0]const u8', found '*const [14]u8'\n</span>    _ = printf(&amp;non_null_terminated_msg);\n               <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/sentinel-terminated_pointer.zig:11:16: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">destination pointer requires '0' sentinel\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/sentinel-terminated_pointer.zig:4:34: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">parameter type declared here\n</span>pub extern \"c\" fn printf(format: [*:0]const u8, ...) c_int;\n                                 <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-2m\">referenced by:\n    callMain [inlined]: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:788:64\n    callMainWithArgs [inlined]: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:729:20\n    main: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:754:28\n    1 reference(s) hidden; use '-freference-trace=4' to see all references\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Sentinel-Terminated-Slices\">哨兵终止切片</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Sentinel-Terminated-Arrays\">哨兵终止数组</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":97,"translated":97}}
